  exerciseTitle: Scenario (To-Do)
  videoWalkthroughUrl: https://unitycodemonkey.teachable.com/courses/problem-solving/lectures/63459479
  exerciseText: 'Quest System that keeps track of active Quests and each Quest can
    have its own logic to have any kind of requirements.


    In this Scenario,
    there are 2 NPCs that the Player can interact with, each of them gives a different
    Quest. The Quests show up in the UI, one quest requires the player to pick up
    Apples and the other Quest requires the player to Walk.


    <b>NOTE: Completing
    this Exercise will DELETE all the files, so if you want to keep your own personal
    implementation of this System then make a BACKUP before clicking on Complete
    Exercise!</b>'
